{
  "chapter": "iv",
  "quests": [
    {
      "key": "gg.iv.intro",
      "title": "Power Armor Era",
      "tier": "IV",
      "desc": "Tungstensteel opens the IV door: blaster rifles, the De-Atomizer pistols, a scatter laser, the golden revolver, and the powered suits that make a player feel like a tank. IV is also where flight arrives, with the Anti Gravity Device.\n\nEverything in this tier is built in the IV Assembler at 7,680 EU/t. Energy guns are tier 5 electric items: they take a Lapotronic Orb as their battery and a good dose of soldering alloy, they come out uncharged, and they only charge in an IV charger or battery buffer. Power armor works the same way.\n\nPlan your power first. A guns-only base can get by on a single IV buffer, but a full suit and a back device want a proper charging line.\n\n[note]Press R over any item in NEI for its exact recipe. Quests only check what you carry; they never take it.[/note]",
