      "key": "gg.iv.blaster",
      "title": "Blaster Rifle",
      "tier": "IV",
      "desc": "The Blaster Rifle is the high-damage energy rifle of the IV tier: a laser with an IV emitter behind it and a Lapotronic Orb for a battery. It is the weapon that makes Laser Rifles feel like toys.\n\nBuild it in the IV Assembler from a Laser Barrel, a Carbon Receiver, a Carbon Gunstock, an IV emitter, a Lapotronic Orb, two IV circuits, a glass lens, tungstensteel plates and screws, and soldering alloy. NEI has the full list.\n\n[note]It is an electric item of tier 5. Only an IV charger or battery buffer will charge it.[/note]",
