      "key": "gg.iv.scatter",
      "title": "Scatter Laser Rifle",
      "tier": "IV",
      "desc": "A laser that fires a spread of five beams. Up close, it is brutal. Further out, the beams spread apart, so keep it for rooms and corridors.\n\nBuild it in the IV Assembler from two Laser Barrels, a Carbon Receiver and Gunstock, two IV emitters, a Lapotronic Orb, two IV circuits, and tungstensteel plates and screws. The extra barrel and emitter pay for the extra beams. NEI has the exact list.\n\n[note]It is a tier 5 electric item, so it charges at an IV buffer only.[/note]",
