      "key": "gg.iv.deatomizer",
      "title": "De-Atomizer Pistol",
      "tier": "IV",
      "desc": "A compact energy pistol. The akimbo version holds a pair, one in each hand, for twice the volume of fire.\n\nBuild one in the IV Assembler from a Laser Barrel, a Sonic Emitter, Mechanical Parts T3, a Lapotronic Orb, an IV circuit, titanium and tungstensteel plates and screws. To make the pair, put two identical pistols in the crafting grid. The quest takes either one.\n\n[note]The akimbo pair is an electric item too. Charge it at an IV buffer.[/note]",
