    {
      "key": "gg.iv.power_plating",
      "title": "Power Plating",
      "tier": "IV",
      "desc": "Power Plating is the armor core of every powered suit. It is a heavy composite of tungstensteel and epoxy fiber, and it is what the power armor is made of.\n\nCraft two at a time in the IV Assembler from two tungstensteel plates, four Epoxid Fiber Reinforced plates, a Mechanical Parts T3 and two EV circuits. NEI shows the exact recipe. You will use several per suit, so make a stack.\n\n[note]Power armor is far hungrier for Power Plating than the Exo Suit is, so build a lot.[/note]",
