    {
      "key": "gg.iv.exo",
      "title": "Exo Suit",
      "tier": "IV",
      "desc": "The Exo Suit is the lighter powered suit. It trades some of the power armor's resistance for a better jump and a lower build cost, and it is the upgrade path for the Advanced Combat armor you built at EV.\n\nEach piece is an upgrade in the IV Assembler: an Advanced Combat piece, Mechanical Parts T3, an IV circuit, an IV electric motor and a tungstensteel plate. The Advanced Combat piece is used up and the Exo piece comes out fresh. Charge the chestplate at an IV buffer for the bonuses.\n\n[note]You need both tiers: the Advanced Combat piece is EV work, the upgrade is IV.[/note]",
